        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Marble Blast Ultra is the latest in the classic Marble Blast series. Suitable for players of any age, Marble Blast Ultra transports you to a futuristic 'astrolab' arena suspended high in the clouds. Compete against each other by navigating your marbles through moving platforms and dangerous hazards, while collecting rare gems and power-up enhancements, in an effort to complete each course in record time. Compete head to head in Xbox Live ultra blast multiplayer mode.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Marble Blast Ultra es la última entrega de la clásica serie Marble Blast. Apto para jugadores de cualquier edad, Marble Blast Ultra te transporta a una arena futurista de «astrolab» suspendida en lo alto de las nubes. Compite con otros guiando tus canicas a través de plataformas móviles y peligros, mientras recoges gemas raras y potenciadores, con el objetivo de completar cada recorrido en el menor tiempo posible. Compite cara a cara en el modo multijugador ultra blast de Xbox Live.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
